        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-461 (ensure controlled execution — Phased Delivery Execution &amp; Site Coordination (PA-77.2).) | - operational: Contractor Site Manager sign-off on the workflow output
Owner: Contractor Site Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
