      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2706_Task6" name="Contractor identifies surplus: unused tiles, excess cement, leftover lumber…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Contractor identifies surplus: unused tiles, excess cement, leftover lumber, extra fixtures; contacts Rep; verifies eligibility (unused condition, within return window)
Responsible (R): Contractor / Trade Sales Rep
Accountable (A): Trade Sales Manager
Duration: 1–2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2706_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2706_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2706_Task7" name="Logistics arranges pickup; Receiving Clerk processes return: inspects…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Logistics arranges pickup; Receiving Clerk processes return: inspects condition, accepts if resaleable, routes to inventory
Responsible (R): Logistics / Receiving Clerk
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: 3–5 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2706_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2706_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2706_Task8" name="Finance processes credit: at original price minus restocking fee (5–10%)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance processes credit: at original price minus restocking fee (5–10%); adjusts billing; Trade Sales Rep conducts project close-out review
Responsible (R): Finance / Trade Sales Rep
Accountable (A): Finance Controller
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2706_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2706_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
