      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Multiple vendors with different lead times
Frequency: Per project; ongoing
Volume: ~20–30 active projects
Owner: Procurement Manager
Participants: Procurement Mgr, Trade Sales Mgr, Supply Planning, Vendors
Source: workflow W2707 — Multi-Vendor Project Material Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2707_LaneSet4">
