        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-182 (ensure jobsite delivery accuracy &amp; site reconciliation.) | - CTL-461 (compliance-monitoring — links to VS-22); Operational: Trade Sales Manager sign-off on the workflow output
Owner: Trade Sales Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
